  m_text: '<b>Beer Pong</b>: a port of the beer pong table in Thryrallo''s UdonPrefabs
    (github.com/Thryrallo/UdonPrefabs), MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2022 Thryrallo.

    Changed
    for Altspace: the port''s own table and cup models and wood texture, URP materials,
    TextMesh Pro text, a physics ball owned by the thrower, a charge bar by the ball.

    Sounds:
    Kenney Impact Sounds and Interface Sounds (kenney.nl, CC0); water splash by ezwa
    (OpenGameArt, CC0).

    Font: an atlas of Dosis, Copyright (c) 2011 Edgar Tolentino
    and Pablo Impallari, Copyright (c) 2011 Igino Marini, SIL Open Font License 1.1.'
